5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I need to know how much time we lose during the switch and every morning after.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The budget line hasn't changed since we were half this size. I need the actual cost.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to decide who gets the worse seats before we just let habit decide.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Comfort is invisible on a map. I need to know what the room actually feels like.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Who sits next to whom changes how we talk. I want to see the current plan.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the cost is high, maybe we shouldn't move at all?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, I am checking the billing basis. It might be cheaper than we think.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Yumi, the survey data might show what people actually want, not just what they say.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I am looking at the sound levels. Noise is a comfort issue.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, I am checking the arrival times. If people come at different times, it matters.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I am looking at the morning routine upstairs. It shows how long setup takes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I am also looking at the facilities quote. Every move costs money.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I am looking at the drawn plan against the survey. It shows the daylight issue.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I am looking at the physio note. My body needs specific adjustments.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I am looking at what the new joiners reported. It shows how we learn.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
