35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The morning routine takes up to nine minutes. That is huge for my gaps.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"We are billed for area, not heads. Empty desks still cost us 41,000 yen a month.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The plan gives only four desks windows. Daylight was the top complaint in the survey.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The printer row is nine decibels louder. My chair needs days to settle properly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The new joiners learned by overhearing. If we sit apart, we lose that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if we keep the same desks, do we save the 6,200 yen per desk?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, yes, but the empty desks are a waste. We need to use the space better.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if we move you to the window, does the noise go away?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, yes, the window side is quieter. But my chair setup will be ruined.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, if we group by function, do we lose the cross-talk?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I hate the idea of clearing my desk every day. It eats my morning.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The facilities quote is steep. We should minimize moves.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,We need to be fair. The window seats are valuable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,I need a stable spot. Moving blocks will reset my comfort every time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I want to sit near people I talk to. Function groups might isolate us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
