63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option C is best for me. I can set up my chair once and keep it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option C might isolate us. Option B keeps us together but moves us.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, if we do Option C, can we promise not to move you?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
