73,3,3,talk,Shion,,I am leaning towards C. It respects my comfort needs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I am leaning towards C. It allows for better collaboration.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
